{
  "words": [
    {
      "word": "Washington once let Boeing check much of its own plane.",
      "offsetSec": 0.0,
      "durationSec": 3.12,
      "frame": 0
    },
    {
      "word": "Then two of them fell out of the sky.",
      "offsetSec": 4.04,
      "durationSec": 1.48,
      "frame": 121
    },
    {
      "word": "Last month, America's AI giants promised to police themselves.",
      "offsetSec": 6.4,
      "durationSec": 3.44,
      "frame": 192
    },
    {
      "word": "Their own tests.",
      "offsetSec": 10.44,
      "durationSec": 0.6,
      "frame": 313
    },
    {
      "word": "An auditor they pick.",
      "offsetSec": 11.5,
      "durationSec": 1.18,
      "frame": 345
    },
    {
      "word": "Is it binding?",
      "offsetSec": 13.18,
      "durationSec": 0.44,
      "frame": 395
    },
    {
      "word": "The president said: \"morally binding.\" Here's why that sounds familiar.",
      "offsetSec": 14.16,
      "durationSec": 3.64,
      "frame": 425
    },
    {
      "word": "Boeing was racing Airbus.",
      "offsetSec": 18.72,
      "durationSec": 1.22,
      "frame": 562
    },
    {
      "word": "So it bolted bigger engines onto an old plane, and added hidden software that could push the nose down.",
      "offsetSec": 20.26,
      "durationSec": 5.2,
      "frame": 608
    },
    {
      "word": "Most pilots were never told it existed.",
      "offsetSec": 26.02,
      "durationSec": 1.88,
      "frame": 781
    },
    {
      "word": "Three hundred and forty-six people died in two crashes.",
      "offsetSec": 29.24,
      "durationSec": 2.14,
      "frame": 877
    },
    {
      "word": "Congress found a \"culture of concealment.\" Now AI is racing China.",
      "offsetSec": 32.32,
      "durationSec": 4.26,
      "frame": 970
    },
    {
      "word": "A plan to show new models to the government ninety days before release was cut to thirty, and made voluntary.",
      "offsetSec": 37.08,
      "durationSec": 5.44,
      "frame": 1112
    },
    {
      "word": "But one difference matters.",
      "offsetSec": 43.2,
      "durationSec": 1.08,
      "frame": 1296
    },
    {
      "word": "Boeing had a referee that could ground every plane on Earth.",
      "offsetSec": 44.98,
      "durationSec": 2.42,
      "frame": 1349
    },
    {
      "word": "For the most powerful AI, there isn't one.",
      "offsetSec": 48.02,
      "durationSec": 2.08,
      "frame": 1441
    },
    {
      "word": "Will AI be different?",
      "offsetSec": 50.76,
      "durationSec": 0.7,
      "frame": 1523
    },
    {
      "word": "Tell me in the comments.",
      "offsetSec": 52.02,
      "durationSec": 0.62,
      "frame": 1561
    }
  ],
